From: S A Muqthyar Ahmed <syed.abdul.muqthyar.ahmed@intel.com>
Date: Thu, 5 Nov 2026 20:06:24 +0530
Subject: [PATCH] Backport-only: Add Ocode firmware linkage for Xe module

Add Ocode firmware info for xe module. This will help add Ocode into
initramfs during creation using metadata info.

Signed-off-by: S A Muqthyar Ahmed <syed.abdul.muqthyar.ahmed@intel.com>
---
 drivers/gpu/drm/xe/xe_late_bind_fw.c | 2 ++
 1 file changed, 2 insertions(+)

diff --git a/drivers/gpu/drm/xe/xe_late_bind_fw.c b/drivers/gpu/drm/xe/xe_late_bind_fw.c
index 355d7c841..610dfc8ae 100644
--- a/drivers/gpu/drm/xe/xe_late_bind_fw.c
+++ b/drivers/gpu/drm/xe/xe_late_bind_fw.c
@@ -24,6 +24,8 @@
  *       Ocode firmware binary is available upstream.
  */
 
+MODULE_FIRMWARE("xe/cri_ocode_27.bin");
+
 /*
  * The component should load quite quickly in most cases, but it could take
  * a bit. Using a very big timeout just to cover the worst case scenario
-- 
